  "name": "Coriander Roast Chicken Thighs with Puy Lentil Salad",
  "subtitle": "Spiced chicken with warm lentils and roasted vegetables",
  "description": "Yogurt-marinated chicken roasts over peppers, onions, and cauliflower, then pairs with tender puy lentils and a cumin-scented finish.",
